# Pre-refinement Validation

---

This folder contains a pre-refinement validation of the original protein structure using three tools:

1. ERRAT: This validation tool was used to evaluate overall quality/unfavorable non-bonded interactions.
Attached files include ERRAT overall quality factor (.pdf) and ERRAT plot (.png) showing key unfavorable regions.

2. PROCHECK: This tool was used to evaluate the stereochemical quality via the Ramachandran plot.
Attached files include the Ramachandran plot (.pdf), All Residue plot (.pdf), and PROCHECK Summary (.txt).

3. Verify3D: This validation tool was used to evaluate compatibility between the 3D structure and its amino-acid sequence environment.
Attached files include Verify3D plot (.png)

Included here in this folder are also the combined pre-validation results of all 3 tools.
